{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the first 5 rounds of the game, giving you a taste of what's to come. You'll have the opportunity to recruit troops, purchase weapons and armor, and get familiar with the core gameplay mechanics. Along the way, you'll encounter a selection of enemy troops\u2014representing some of the unit types available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 5th round, you'll face off against a randomly selected boss, offering a glimpse of the challenges that lie ahead. Once you've successfully completed the 5th wave, the demo will come to an end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588690?t=1741924962","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588690?t=1741924962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588690/0cc7c352bd0997086c49dda9487a152599572444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741924962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588690/0cc7c352bd0997086c49dda9487a152599572444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741924962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the first 5 rounds of the game, giving you a taste of what's to come. You'll have the opportunity to recruit troops, purchase weapons and armor, and get familiar with the core gameplay mechanics. Along the way, you'll encounter a selection of enemy troops\u2014representing some of the unit types available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 5th round, you'll face off against a randomly selected boss, offering a glimpse of the challenges that lie ahead. Once you've successfully completed the 5th wave, the demo will come to an end.</p>","developers":["-drakula-747"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2697610","name":"Keep of the knights"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588690/3af936e3767be4f1e044f7c015fc253c1f180eec/header.jpg?t=1741924962","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113014,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113014/movie480.mp4?t=1741924871","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113014/movie_max.mp4?t=1741924871"},"name":"KOTK Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113014/4a1008d3d0f9f5bd27206caa3191b18717e02829/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741924871","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113014/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741924871","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113014/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741924871"}}],"name":"Keep of the knights Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX-6300 @ 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX-6300 @ 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4770 @ 3.4 GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 1600 @ 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or AMD R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li